+
+# Summary
+
+Added `createPatch(from, to)` to `src/index.ts`, returning an RFC 6902 patch of only the differences
+(member-wise for objects, prefix/suffix-trimmed for arrays). Tests in `test/createpatch.test.ts`
+check round-trip via `applyPatch`, minimality for small changes, escaping, `__proto__`, type changes
+and non-mutation. Decision: dl-005.
